# graphify knowledge graph
# The portable graph artifacts are tracked (see .gitattributes for the
# graph.json merge driver). Everything else under graphify-out/ is machine
# specific, derived, or churns on every rebuild.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!graphify-out/.graphify_labels.json
